  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "Terrain import lands all 3 asymmetric orientation anchors (start SW, graveyard W, forest E) correctly",
    "Bridge anchors align at approximately +112m without filling the underlying chasm",
    "Castle site is terraced, not a single rectangular flat mountain",
    "All playable uphill ground routes have feasible grade or clearly designated stair/switchback geometry",
    "Opening castle skyline visible from starting overlook with actual character camera",
    "Major building foundations preserved while scenic slopes remain natural",
    "Boss arena +181m is clearly flagged as modular architecture, not Landscape height",
    "Rasters/JSON can be revised without shifting world coordinate definitions"
  ],
  "risk_notes": [
    "The illustrative maps have inconsistent perspective and scales; these coordinates are a feasible authored interpretation, not survey data.",
    "A 690x615m architectural site is not equivalent to a 690x615m flat terrace; only local foundation masks are flat.",
    "Gothic and Dark Fantasy demos use broad architectural AABBs that include shells and supports; their footprints do not mandate the same terrain shape.",
    "Actual gate/bridge connection widths, pivots and player collisions must be verified in UE at L2.",
    "High tower tips can be 200m+ above the terrain, independent of Landscape sculpt height.",
    "The 2017x2017 landscape has 256 components vs 64 at 1009x1009; profile landscape/foliage before detailed painting."
  ],
  "next_stage": "L1B: heightmap generation with terrain hardpads, protected road corridors, river drainage and preview iterations; keep architectural geometry in Astra L2."
}